Subject: [GenABEL-dev] ProbABEL v0.2.0 is out!
Message-ID: <4FD65830.3070109@karssen.org>

Dear list,

It is with great pleasure that I announce the release of ProbABEL
v0.2.0. This release marks the transition to the autoconf/autmake
framework, as well as the (temporary) removal of the pacoxph functionality.

The source can be found on the GenABEL website at:
http://www.genabel.org/packages/ProbABEL

For those using Ubuntu (or one of its derivative distro's): you can use
the GenABEL PPA to install the ProbABEL package (see
https://launchpad.net/~l.c.karssen/+archive/genabel-ppa).

Check out the release announcement on the forum:
http://forum.genabel.org/viewtopic.php?f=10&t=648&p=1089#p1089

Future plans are:
- Fix of pacoxph
- Integration of Maarten's ProbABEL-refactoring branch


Best,

Lennart.
--
